{"description":"Follow-up from CTX-0294 (PR wiring minimal rounded border ring via FillRect scanline geometry). The minimal ring paints the outer frame silhouette, gap bands, and straight border edges on both backends by construction, but does NOT clip glyph/cell sub-cell overhang at the four inner corner arcs, and emits per-corner-row fills instead of a fragment SDF.

